uencing  more people my advice to emerging  designers would be you have to follow  your heart whatever we want to do but be  more critical about what you do because  we live in a time where it's very  crowded keep on pushing  if you don't think your dairy then you  know push it harder I'm Larry pay  creative director designer of the year  you
 

